<description>&lt;p&gt;Ebola has reached an eighth province in eastern DRC, prompting alerts in Lubumbashi and border closures by Kenya and Uganda after 12 truck drivers were killed. The ADF continues attacks in Ituri while the FRN operates near Lubumbashi, and both UPDF and FARDC are conducting joint operations against ADF commanders in the region. A mercenary force suffered combat casualties in the Congo, and rebel-linked violence has led to civilian deaths. The conflict produced 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNVzVCTE1NNkpZZXNHYlBFeGp2VW41Z2s5b0R4YXlVU21qcER1Uk5Qd1JHRG05YmRTdW9JdF9XR0xvUTduQ2EtSVYycjhiTHh6NEdFZUVqV1NaX3FzWlktbzBmUGVPSXZQdmIyWWZvMHRUN2w3Z2VxaFc1Y0luRkRmM0k2YzhsaDJmMG9yM1JMdWVkcnlHVE1NYVdQTktjdFpOTk8xWl96Ym1nY3VONW9LRDBUUXdmN3loUW12Tw?oc=5&quot;&gt;eNCA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPRHFseWxaY3dNcUI3dUo0V1gyVm1xZkprZ3Y5NmtUak02Tm5aZ24wTndZWFByaElEWnVBc2N2alNaaDJLX2QtM1M5c0xYdUYzTUxMakMxV1pkYTNKVTFZTmJrNUtuaUxUalhWbXBkVmJPMTFSRXlyVnR6UGJreUFmR3BEaEdLWGFITHRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Voice of Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOazhOQVdFLVlwM1lBU2ZFcGk0WEtGOWpnZzhib2YwWURNTFYxTVdXem5yMUE4dUhGOGs2a3BwejZqdVZMaml3RnJ5UDk0YXBBc0Zkb3BRX1B5eTBpT1ZWcC1LYnRkeGVEMmRiWHV1UkN1X2c0OHprU3dfaHowbXR4bg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ChimpReports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNQWdYXzkwUE1xUDBLWkg0YnJWY3pkZXJ3OVc3QlBMYVpUY0kxZTVsS0lNT2IxV2d1dlhIT0ZqY19WaFhUWmIySWxjTGE3UXdWejFBZzhmQjNpeHVNT0I0NlE1cUtpa2Y4bklPMDBTYWxic2tXMzFJcUFyenhRQ2xYY3lHdnFlVlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northwest A